mod:give_defer_rewrites;
// WHAT A `defer` BODY DID, A ROAD THAT GAVE THROUGH IT INHERITS WHOLE (DEF-535, HIGH, pre-existing, landing 177d2b). A `give`
// runs the `defer`s of the blocks it leaves, and the landing of a block's bodies handed the arm's `give` road only what a body
// FORBIDS (a move, a free, a seal, a write), so what a body UN-PERMITS never reached it: a `Result` rewritten by the body stayed
// checked after the pick, and a page the body re-made stayed sealed. One module per cell, each accepted before this landing
// and each wrong when run (60: `.value` of an error; 74: `.err` of a value; 97: an unsealed page called).
//   The three facts a body can take back: `checked` (`a1`, `a3`, `a6`, `a7`, `a9`, `a10`, `gl1`, `lz1`, `h1` to `h9`),
//   `errchecked` (`a4`), `sealed_firm` (`a2`). The fourth permit, `must`, has no hole: a body can only assign more.
//   The body's forms: a plain rewrite, one under an `if` (`h1`), in a loop (`h2`), in a `pick` (`h3`), in a `defer` of its
//   own (`h4`), and the later of two bodies (`a6`).
//   The `give`'s places: in an `if` (`a3`), in both arms of a nested `if` (`h5`), in an inner block (`a7`), in a loop (`gl1`),
//   in an `if`'s block that holds the `defer` too, with a `pass` after it (`h9`), in an inner value `pick` (`a9`), in a guarded
//   arm (`a10`) and the wildcard's (`h8`).
//   The pick's places: a declaration's value, a call's argument (`h6`), an operand read beside `r.value` in one expression
//   (`h7`), and the right of `&&` (`lz1`).
//   REFUSED BEFORE THIS LANDING TOO, pinned here: the body's block ends before the `give` (`a1k_defer_block_ends_before_give`),
//   a statement `pick` (`a1k_statement_pick_defer`), a `give` out of a `for` or a `when` whose body holds the `defer` (`a5`,
//   `a11`), a body that moves what's read after (`a8k`), and `h9`'s shape with a `give` after the `if` (`k9`: the block's end
//   reaches that `give` through the `if`'s merge).
//   THE PRICES, right on every road and refused. The landing merges the BLOCK'S END into the road, all eight facts, and it
//   does so for every block of the arm that holds a `defer` and ends after the arm's first `give`. So a road loses a permit
//   it had at its `give` wherever such a block's end doesn't have it, whatever the body does: a `defer` written after the
//   `give` (`pg1_give_before_defer_price`: that road never ran it); a body that touches nothing of it, the permit earned in
//   the `if` that gives (`pd1`, TAINT-001; `pd3`, ASSIGN-001); a later block the road never entered (`pd2`). Their twins
//   without the `defer` are in the program beside this file (`pd1c`, `pd2c`, `pd3c`).
